        "description": "I am an Artificial Intelligence Engineer with a strong background in Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Computer Vision, Natural Language Processing, Generative AI, and Reinforcement Learning. Experienced in developing,\n        evaluating, and deploying AI models and building end-to-end AI solutions. Alongside my expertise in AI, I have\n        knowledge of software engineering, cloud and computing infrastructure, and deployment technologies, allowing me\n        to bridge the gap between AI research, model development, and production-ready systems."
